# Rust build output. Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: binary workspace.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Profiling / coverage. Not a blanket *.svg: copycat.svg is a tracked asset.
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data*
flamegraph.svg

*.orig
*.rej

# copycat local state: never commit clipboard data or keys.
*.copycat-db
*.copycat-key
*.sock
/secrets

.env
.env.*
.secrets
*.log

# Python eval harness. uv.lock stays tracked if the harness grows one.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.ruff_cache/

# Editors
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code: deny per-user state, re-include shared project config. Needs
# `.claude/*`, since git cannot re-include under an excluded directory.
#
# Skills are NOT re-included. They wrap the same build and test commands
# CLAUDE.md documents, for one harness, and a second copy of those commands is
# a second thing to keep true. CLAUDE.md is the tracked one.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Scratch and eval output
/tmp
/evals/computer-use/harness/tmp
/evals/output/

# Local-only writing guide. Not shipped: it is working notes on voice, and it
# necessarily contains the em dashes its own rule 1 forbids, in the rule that
# forbids them, so it can never satisfy scripts/check-docs.sh.
docs/VOICE.md
